<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O behold, from the throne of our God and the Lamb</l><l>Flows a river of water of life</l><l>God the source, Christ the fount, God the Spirit the flow,</l><l>Springing up as a river of life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus Lord, from my spirit I turn unto Thee</l><l>Open wide, call Thy name, drink Thee in;</l><l>Dearest Lord, to this stream I outpour utterly;</l><l>Triune God, flow as life, flood my being.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
